/* Mock tests in the official format (Ministry of Health briefing, 24.10.2026): 5 stations of 15 minutes.
   1 internal medicine, 2 adult surgical, 3 child, 4 women's health (actor: conversation + teaching),
   5 knowledge test (30 questions: mental health, pharmacology, laws and circulars, calculations).
   New stations below fill the surgical, pediatric and women's-health slots (Brunner & Suddarth, Wong's, Olds').
   Steps use the station format: { k, v (monitor), s:[en,es], c:[[score,en,es,whyEn,whyEs]] }. */

